{"id":"kholm","lemma":"холм","pos":"noun","rank":4413,"glosses":["hill"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"холма","plural":"холмы"},"examples":[{"text":"Том сбежал с холма.","en":"Tom ran down the hill.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to run down","l":"сбежать"},{"g":"with / from"},null]},{"text":"Холм был весь в снегу.","en":"The hill was all covered with snow.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"snow","l":"снег"}]},{"text":"Он живёт на вершине холма.","en":"He lives at the top of the hill.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},{"g":"on / at"},null,null]},{"text":"Я взбежал на холм.","en":"I ran up the hill.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Его дом стоит у подножия холма.","en":"His house is at the foot of the hill.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"to stand","l":"стоять"},{"g":"at / by"},null,null]}]}